Purpose of Job
To create a safe stable underground working environment in at a colliery of Sasol Mining. This is a middle management position with substantial operational duties and responsibilities. Main focus of this job is to design/develop and assist in implementing systems, procedures and techniques that will ensure mine stability of all coal mines of Sasol Mining. This will include inputs into the training material as well as underground coaching of all levels of personnel. Due to the nature of the post the incumbent will operate with a wide variety of individuals and in varying group sizes.
